Package: power4ctl
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Jim Studt <jim@studt.net>
Depends: libc6, libedit2
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Description: Serial and authenticated TCP management tool for power4
 Command-line tool for querying and managing a power4 ESP32 controller
 over its serial or authenticated TCP console. Supports JSON state reports,
 policy program upload, and general-purpose passthrough access.
